WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.100
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:24.100
If I open this door, I'll find a new world

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.520
A world only just beginning

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:34.770
Even if there are tough times ahead

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:41.160
I'm sure I'll make it through

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:48.580
Now I'm making my way through this new world

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:54.900
And I've got hopes and dreams

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.700
I'm excited, I'm restless

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.260
Nobody can stop me

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:01.300
My heart is all fired up
Nobody can stop me

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:06.430
My heart is all fired up

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.460
From here I'll leap into the world

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:10.520
Taking to the sky
From here I'll leap into the world

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.650
Taking to the sky

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:19.680
Aiming for tomorrow and beyond

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:26.060
I believe that someday I'll grow up

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:31.120
That's why I'll spread my wings wide

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:54.790
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:56.950
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.250
<i>And I'm Jasmine.</i>

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:03.420
<i>We're currently travelling to seven perilous places in order to recover the seven stolen gems!</i>

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:07.430
<i>We've already acquired the topaz,
ruby, opal, and the lapis lazuli!</i>

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:10.940
<i>We had to face some monsters, but they weren't anything we couldn't handle!</i>

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:16.940
<i>Hey now, we don't know what kinds of enemies we'll have to face in the future. You both need to be careful.</i>

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.540
<i>Geez, you worry too much, Barda!</i>

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:24.250
<i>And right now, we're headed to
Dread Mountain where the fifth gem is located!</i>

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:34.900
We refuse.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:39.400
All we ask is that you carry us to Dread Mountain.

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:42.290
Of course, I know it's dangerous, but please.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:48.100
I absolutely refuse to risk having any of my Kin fall victim to the Dread Gnomes' poisoned arrows.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:54.290
Don't any of you want to
visit your home again?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.820
That's...

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.070
Of course we want to...

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.120
We <i>do</i> want to return...

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:05.400
Our purpose in going to Dread Mountain is to restore peace to the Kingdom of Deltora.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:07.790
You're so cool, Lief!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:12.200
Restoring peace to the Kingdom of Deltora...?

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.150
Then, does that mean we'd be
able to return to the mountain?

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:18.710
Are you saying that we'd be able
to eat the Boolong cones again?

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:24.100
Yes, but for that to happen, we need to get to Dread Mountain first; as soon as possible.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:27.350
Don't you think this is worth a try, everyone?

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.070
Besides, Lief did risk his
life to save Prin, didn't he?

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.350
So it's a given that we should
return the favour, right?

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:35.800
Exactly!

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.500
You three! Don't start making
decisions on your own!

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:45.100
But I also want to go, Crenn!
I owe my life to Lief, after all!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:47.100
So now it's my turn to help him!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.570
Prin... But you see...

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.500
No means no. I have witnessed more than enough death among my comrades.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:58.300
I hope you can respect our
decision, Good Travellers.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:06.300
It seems that not even trying to
persuade them all day worked, then...

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:09.500
Why can't Elder Crenn understand our goal?

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:16.410
He's just being a good leader and prioritising
everyone's happiness and safety above all else.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:19.050
So you'll be giving up on your plan, then?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:24.550
Yes, it can't be helped. We have no other choice but to head to Dread Mountain on foot.

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.510
How far would you say Dread Mountain is from here?

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.600
Roughly two weeks by foot, I suppose.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.000
Two weeks?!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.250
We will be crossing several mountains, after all.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:38.790
Although, we would probably
reach it in no time if we could fly...

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:45.830
Oh well, we <i>were</i> going to walk
all that way from the start anyway.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:48.900
Now, let's get some rest so we
can be ready for tomorrow.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.400
What's the matter?

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:57.210
I'm thinking of having another
drink from the Dreaming Spring.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:07.200
Father... Mother...

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.400
Where am I...?

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:30.690
Father!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.700
Father...

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:36.500
I've missed you...!

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:42.800
Father? It's me, Lief!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.000
Do you not recognise me?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:49.400
I'm right here. Father? Can't you hear me?

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:56.800
I see... Right now I'm just
a soul that has left its body,

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.660
so I cannot be seen or heard...

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:14.700
Who is this?!

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:19.600
Have you been enjoying your
stay here, Jarred the Blacksmith?

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:21.800
P-Prandine...!

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:28.400
Prandine?! Isn't that the name of King Endon's adviser who turned out to be the Shadow Lord's servant?!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.960
You... But back then...!

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.000
<i>There's no one there! Honestly!</i>

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.300
<i>Out of the way! I will decide that for myself!</i>

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:43.800
<i>Unhand me!</i>

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.870
There was no mistaking it; you were dead!

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:52.200
Most certainly. Prandine did die.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:53.830
Then, who are you?!

00:06:54.190 --> 00:07:01.710
My name is Fallow, the Shadow Lord's loyal servant as well as the current ruler of the Kingdom of Deltora.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.010
But, your appearance is exactly-

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:08.980
For one reason or another, the Shadow Lord took a liking to that man's appearance, you see...

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:12.810
So, he ordered me to adopt
that very same appearance.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:16.800
And so, I ended up looking like this.

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:19.560
Dad!

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.670
Now, how about you start talking?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.800
Stop that!!

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:31.450
Why was it that we came by this book in your house,
when this book belongs in the Del Palace's library?!

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:32.800
The Belt of Deltora...!

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.710
I haven't a clue...

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:43.500
Feigning ignorance, are you? With this, you can no longer deny that you indeed assisted and harboured that foolish Endon!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:52.500
Please spare me your stupidity. That foolish Endon treated me as a traitor in my youth, you know?

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.320
As if I would harbour such a man!

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:59.110
Is that all you have to say?

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:01.310
What of your son?! Where is he right now?!

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:06.600
You really can't help yourself from
dredging up bad memories, can you?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:12.500
That idiot ran away from home a few months ago because he didn't want to be a blacksmith!

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.380
How should I know where he is-

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.550
That is a lie!

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:16.870
Father!!

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:22.330
It has all been revealed now.
According to the report I have,

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:28.320
three travellers have been defeating my master's
servants one after another, stealing their treasures.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:34.820
They have been identified as a middle-aged man, a young boy as well as a girl.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:41.360
That young boy is your son, and the
middle-aged man must be Endon himself.

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.870
Well, can you still play dumb after hearing that?

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:47.900
I was right on the mark, wasn't I?

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.800
Now that's quite the laugh!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.230
What?

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:03.640
If Endon had that much courage, then he
wouldn't have lost his kingdom in the first place!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:08.640
And if my son had that kind of dedication, he would have had no reason to leave home!

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:15.600
In reality, Endon is little more than a cowardly fool, while my son is just a good-for-nothing.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.800
Father!! How dare you do that to him...!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.000
You will prepare a better
response for my next visit.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:22.700
Shit!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.600
You will prepare a better
response for my next visit.

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:28.910
It seems that not even torture
will get you to talk, but...

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:34.830
I wonder what you will do when we torture your beloved wife instead...

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:37.000
W-What did you just say?!

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:48.750
So Lief and Barda are still alive...!

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:52.800
They are still alive and searching
for the seven gems...!

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.600
That's right!

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:58.330
We have already recovered
four out of seven, Father!

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:03.200
And right now, we're on our way to
Dread Mountain to grab the fifth one!

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:07.740
So please, keep holding on and don't give up!

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:11.900
Lief, Barda... I will not give in!

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:19.540
So I hope that my prayers will reach you, and that you will both stay strong out there.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:21.300
Father...

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:31.100
You're awake.

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:33.100
How did it go, Lief?

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:42.000
They believe me to be Endon? I'm sure my late mother would get a good laugh if she heard that.

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:49.800
Then, does this mean that they still haven't realised that the beggar near the smithy has also disappeared?

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:51.700
Jasmine?

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:56.400
I... didn't have any dreams last night.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:02.500
I thought that I could at least meet my father in my dreams, but... it was no good.

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:04.300
Jasmine...

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:07.380
But, maybe it's better this way.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:12.910
Perhaps it's better for me to assume that my father is already dead, just like my mother...

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:19.850
Anyway, that's enough chatting. We should get moving; there's no time to waste.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:22.110
Alright then, let's go.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.800
Hey, you three!

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.600
Do you have a moment?

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:33.000
You see, my friends and I
have decided to help you out.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.900
Help us out? I'm very grateful for that, but...

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.310
Does Crenn know about this?

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:42.610
Well that's not good!

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:46.080
It's fine! Just forget about
what that old man says.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.390
We've decided to help you out, after all.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.910
And no one can say or do anything to stop us.

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:52.080
Right?

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:54.920
He didn't even lend an ear to you, right?

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.300
It's no use trying to persuade
him. He's just too stubborn.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.140
Well, that's...

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:03.400
Don't worry, just leave everything to us.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.940
Now, get on.

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:20.360
Then excuse me...

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.300
Wait! Not like that!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.930
Then, where am I supposed to...

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.580
That really suits you, Barda!

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:35.000
Give me a break...

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:39.220
That's quite a large baby
you have there, Merin.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:41.840
And look at how cute it is!

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:45.500
What are you two on about?!
Let's hurry up and get moving!

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:51.400
This is pretty embarrassing...

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:52.460
Right?

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.130
But now we'll get there in no time!

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:55.540
Are you ready?

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.700
Stop right there!

00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:02.000
Who gave you three permission
to fly to Dread Mountain?!

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.080
Crenn!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:08.440
Don't even try to stop us, Crenn! We're going for the sake of the Kin's future!

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:11.720
Have you lost your senses?!

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.950
You will all be struck down by
the Dread Gnome's poison!

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:19.680
He's right! Please reconsider;
what you are doing is foolhardy!

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:24.800
But we need the mountain air along with the Boolong cones in order to breed!

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.300
We should have returned to
our home a long time ago!

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:33.910
Our kind will just disappear forever if we remain here doing nothing!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:37.000
That's why I chose to bet on these travellers!

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:39.890
But can't you just visit the
mountain in your dreams?

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:41.320
I've had enough of dreaming!

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:44.430
I agree with them! I can't even
see the mountain in my dreams!

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:45.210
Prin...

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:47.290
Lief, take me with you too!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:48.010
Prin...

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.880
Take me with you, please...

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:56.800
Sorry little one, but you're
the only child that we have.

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:01.040
That's not fair! I'm not a kid anymore!!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.490
I'm also going to the mountain with Lief!!

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:06.140
Prin! Get back here right now!

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:10.520
Please listen to me and don't trouble the others any more than this, okay?

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:21.200
You lot... Do you see now
what you've done to us?!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:28.600
We had been living in peace and harmony before you came, but now look! We are now feuding with one another!

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:29.900
Now wait just a moment.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.700
You can't blame them for this.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:36.700
We're telling you that we decided to go to Dread Mountain of our own free will!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:42.430
She's right! Or what, Crenn? Do you think that it's fine for us Kin to go extinct?!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:48.000
Of course not! But protecting this last surviving group is what's most important for us!

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:51.490
But, what about Prin's future?

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:54.300
Prin's future...?

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:59.800
Are you telling me that it's okay rob her of her
future so that we can live in 'peace and harmony'?

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:24.330
Perhaps you three are right...

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:32.680
You were fine after drinking from the Dreaming Spring, so there is no doubt that you all have good hearts.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:39.230
Then, perhaps your journey to Dread Mountain, too, will result in a better future for us Kin.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:41.600
Thank you.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:44.100
Well then,

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.700
let's get going!

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:53.100
Make sure you come back alive, you hear me?

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:55.020
Right!

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.710
Now that's a good tailwind! Let's go!

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.220
You're running?!

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.880
Well, we're carrying you after all,
so we need to get up some speed!

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:16.080
Look forward! Forward!!
There's a cliff right ahead!!

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:21.470
Get ready! Off we go!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:53.430
What an incredible view!

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.100
Hey!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.300
Could you please not fly so high?

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:02.220
It'll be bad if we fall!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:03.800
Just keep quiet.

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.300
Lief!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.200
Isn't this amazing?

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:09.900
Yeah!

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.620
Yahoo! Faster, faster!

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:13.860
Fly lower, please!!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.960
So how long will it take to
get to Dread Mountain?

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:26.160
We can't keep flying through the night, but at this rate, we'll probably arrive by tomorrow.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:27.100
Tomorrow?

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:34.400
<i>If by chance, the Dread Gnomes are still guarding the mountain, and they try to shoot us down...</i>

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:36.700
<i>I wonder how far we would fall...</i>

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:40.260
<i>No, everything will be fine.</i>

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:43.500
<i>The four gems will definitely
protect us from danger.</i>

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:51.590
<i>It is said that when the seven gems are all
gathered, they will unleash immense power.</i>

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:56.810
<i>And when Adin and his descendants
wear the Belt of Deltora,</i>

00:17:56.810 --> 00:18:00.000
<i>it is said that they will possess
the power to destroy any foe.</i>

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:05.900
<i>I have to assemble the gems as soon as possible and have the king's direct descendant wear it...!</i>

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:27.990
Let's land around here!

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:28.800
Alright!

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:32.390
Land? But where?

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:39.300
Just leave it to us. We would often rest around here during our round trip from the mountain to the Dreaming Spring in the past.

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:45.210
Everyone called it 'Kinrest'.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.610
As I thought, being able to walk
on solid ground really is best!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.820
You were pretty noisy up there, Barda.

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:10.470
Of course I was. I was afraid her
pouch would rip from my weight.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:13.600
Even though I told him countless
times that it would be fine...

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:18.390
After all, an infant Kin can be much heavier than Barda, and our pouch can handle that.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:20.760
So you really have nothing to worry about!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.600
We're leaving you here if you
do it again tomorrow, you hear?

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:26.900
Forgive me. I will definitely be fine tomorrow.

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:28.380
...I hope.

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:35.690
The trees here sure have
grown since we were kids...

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:39.170
Yeah, so much that we couldn't
see the river from above.

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:43.680
Hey Ailsa, that's the cave that we used to play in when we were little, isn't it?

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:48.120
You're right; it's all covered in moss now. Things sure have changed...

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:53.990
We visited the mountain every night in our dreams, but it's been a while since we've seen this place.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.800
What are the trees here saying, Jasmine?

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:01.200
They're all saying that they're
happy to see the Kin once again.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:06.200
But, their tones sound so sad... It's as if they're afraid of something...

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:10.900
They say that they are still sad to
see someone they loved lose their life here.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.170
When did that happen?

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:20.920
Many of the trees in this area have lived for countless years; they don't pay much attention to the passage of time.

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:22.530
What do you mean?

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:27.300
Whether it happened yesterday or ten years ago, it feels all the same to them.

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:32.360
For that reason, they aren't sure
when this tragedy occurred.

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:37.500
Anyway, do you think it's safe to
light a fire? It's getting a bit cold.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:42.700
The trees are overgrown enough to hide the light, but as a result, it feels a bit gloomy down here.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:44.700
Sure, let's do that.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.800
You three, can you come here for a moment?

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:58.770
We used to play in this cave
when we were children.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:03.400
So, for nostalgia's sake, we had a look inside and found some strange stuff.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:09.690
This is...

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.240
It seems that someone once lived here.

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:13.990
And it wasn't any time recently.

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:18.960
But, there's no doubt that it happened after we left Dread Mountain.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.760
We never once saw a human in here.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.100
But that's not all.

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:32.200
Something is written here.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:41.800
What does it say?

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:45.300
"Here lies Doom of the hills,

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:48.660
who sheltered a friendless
stranger and so meet his death.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.520
He will be avenged."

00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:53.700
Then, this is Doom's grave?!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:55.340
Doom died?!

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:58.000
No. Look closely.

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:02.700
This grave has aged. It's probably
been here for at least 10 years.

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:05.600
Look here! It's the mark of the Resistance!

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:12.100
Does this mean that the Doom
we know has stolen this guy's identity?

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:15.000
Yeah, there's no doubt about it!

00:22:15.760 --> 00:22:19.030
Who would have imagined that
that guy was actually a fake...

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:27.400
Then, who in the world is the
man that we know to be Doom?

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:51.050
On nights when a gentle breeze caresses your cheek

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.550
And you start walking with your head held high

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:57.680
You might just be blessed by the big red sun

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:00.310
When hardships cause you to stumble

00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:02.770
And you keep hanging your head in shame

00:23:03.020 --> 00:23:07.820
Just know that you may end up missing out on that one emotional scene

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:10.610
The Earth, with all of its living things

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:13.240
The sea, sky and sun: seven days of grace

00:23:13.570 --> 00:23:15.990
Not noticing how thirsty I had become

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:18.410
I turned my back on this town and walked away

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:23.670
If you've searched near and far but still can't find the answer to your problem

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:28.050
Before you give up, take a step forward with a bit of courage towards a new chapter

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:30.550
Let's write a new page

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.090
Take my hand, come on, we're gonna go

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:38.180
Whether you're up or down, it's just one second! Get up! Stand up!

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:40.730
Let's write a new page

00:23:41.430 --> 00:23:43.230
Take my hand, come on, we're gonna go

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:48.360
Whether you're laughing or crying, it's just once. Get up! Stand up!

00:24:04.770 --> 00:24:06.930
The Deltora Encyclopedia

00:24:06.930 --> 00:24:07.800
<i>Fallow.
The Deltora Encyclopedia</i>

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:08.300
The Deltora Encyclopedia

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:13.910
<i>The Shadow Lord's closest servant. He has the same appearance as the late Prandine.</i>

00:24:14.200 --> 00:24:19.300
<i>He's currently directing the Grey Guards to track Lief and the others on the Shadow Lord's orders.</i>

00:24:20.590 --> 00:24:24.250
We were ambushed by the Carn Unit once we arrived at Dread Mountain.

00:24:24.250 --> 00:24:27.900
They're way stronger than the
enemies we've faced before!

00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:30.800
But then, another frightening enemy appeared!

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:34.500
Next time, 'Assault! The Monster Vraal'.
